Chapter: BvtTradeCoin
  cites Uoaix chapter GameVendorPackets
  cites Uoaix chapter BvtCheck

 Trade gumps (UOAIX-169): a copper price reads in gold, silver and copper; a priced name fits the client's 64-byte
 field; the receipt is a well-formed 0xB0 gump whose length field is its length.
  btcn-long : Text = "a very long item name that runs well past the room the client gives a name"
  bvt-trade-coin : Integer -> [Console] Integer
  bvt-trade-coin (unused) = let gump = gvp-text-gump 4242 gvp-receipt-id 520 ["Bought from the cobbler", "Total: 1g2s5c"]
    in let priced = gvp-priced btcn-long 130 100 10 in act
      a <- bvt-check "a copper price reads as 6g5s at 100 copper and 10 silver to the gold (gvp-coins)" (gvp-coins 125 100 10 == "1g2s5c" & gvp-coins 100 100 10 == "1g" & gvp-coins 30 100 10 == "3s" & gvp-coins 63 100 10 == "6s3c" & gvp-coins 7 100 10 == "7c" & gvp-coins 0 100 10 == "0c" & gvp-coins 5 1 1 == "5g")
      b <- bvt-check "a priced name reads <item> at 1g3s and fits 63 characters; a short name is kept whole (gvp-priced, UOAIX-225)" (text-length priced <= 63 & substring priced (text-length priced - 8) 8 == " at 1g3s" & gvp-priced "boots" 130 100 10 == "boots at 1g3s" & gvp-priced "scissors" 63 100 10 == "scissors at 6s3c" & gvp-priced "boots" 125 0 0 == "boots")
      c <- bvt-check "the receipt is a 0xB0 gump to the player under the receipt id, its length field its length (gvp-text-gump)" (list-at gump 0 == #B0 & list-at gump 1 * 256 + list-at gump 2 == list-length gump & gp-u32 gump 3 == 4242 & gp-u32 gump 7 == gvp-receipt-id)
      d <- bvt-check "a quote of a gold or more rounds to the nearest silver, under a gold it stays exact; never three coins, never 1g1c (gvp-round, UOAIX-225)" (gvp-round 125 100 10 == 130 & gvp-round 124 100 10 == 120 & gvp-round 101 100 10 == 100 & gvp-coins (gvp-round 101 100 10) 100 10 == "1g" & gvp-coins (gvp-round 1258 100 10) 100 10 == "12g6s" & gvp-round 63 100 10 == 63 & gvp-round 99 100 10 == 99 & gvp-round 7 1 1 == 7)
      a + b + c + d
    end
